            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Создай другой метод, который выводит книги в серии.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"BookSeries\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"def\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"__init__\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(self, name, books)\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    self.name = name\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    self.books = books\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"def\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"print_name\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(self)\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    print(self.name)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"def\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"print_books\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(self)\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    print(self.books)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"hg = BookSeries(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Hunger Games&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", [\" /><text value=\"&quot;The Hunger Games&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Catching Fire&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Mockingjay&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"])\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"hg.print_books()\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"150\" endIndex=\"153\" /><option startIndex=\"154\" endIndex=\"165\" /><option startIndex=\"165\" endIndex=\"166\" /><option startIndex=\"166\" endIndex=\"170\" /><option startIndex=\"170\" endIndex=\"171\" /><option startIndex=\"171\" endIndex=\"172\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"['The Hunger Games', 'Catching Fire', 'Mockingjay']\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Обязательно выбери <code>def</code>, затем <code>print_books</code>, а затем <code>(</code>, <code>self</code>, <code>)</code>, <code>:</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Метод принимает <code>self</code>, а вызывается у созданного экземпляра.</p><p>Заверши метод и вызови его у <code>hg</code>, чтобы код вывел список книг.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"BookSeries\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"def\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"__init__\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(self, name, books)\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    self.name = name\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    self.books = books\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"def\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"print_name\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(self)\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    print(self.name)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"def\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"print_books\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(self)\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    print(self.books)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"hg = BookSeries(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Hunger Games&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", [\" /><text value=\"&quot;The Hunger Games&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Catching Fire&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Mockingjay&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"])\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"hg.print_books()\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"150\" endIndex=\"153\" /><option startIndex=\"154\" endIndex=\"165\" /><option startIndex=\"165\" endIndex=\"166\" /><option startIndex=\"166\" endIndex=\"170\" /><option startIndex=\"170\" endIndex=\"171\" /><option startIndex=\"171\" endIndex=\"172\" /><option startIndex=\"282\" endIndex=\"284\" /><option startIndex=\"285\" endIndex=\"296\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"BookSeries\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"print_name\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"['The Hunger Games', 'Catching Fire', 'Mockingjay']\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Обязательно выбери <code>def</code>, затем <code>print_books</code>, <code>(</code>, <code>self</code>, <code>)</code>, <code>:</code>, <code>hg</code>, и наконец <code>print_books</code>.</p></body></html>"
